      "observed": "D3 (PMEG3030EP, annotated '3A 360mV') is drawn on the +5V rail with its cathode (bar) facing the +5V node and its anode facing the downstream servo-rail node that feeds the C1/C4 bulk capacitors and the servo header power pins.",
